/E (In conclusion, none of the four variables analyzed in this dataset are significantly correlated with consumer spending power. This suggests that the current model should not be heavily relied upon for predicting consumer behavior. Future research should explore alternative variables to gain a deeper and more accurate understanding of the factors influencing spending power.)
/Pg 35 0 R
/K [3]
